  "2026-10-19T18:38:15.339Z",codex-agent,"Fixed ladder completed: 100 subscribers p50/p95/p99 361.4/917.6/1116.6 ms, zero lost/duplicates, PASS; 1000 subscribers 848.2/1565.0/1928.3 ms, zero lost/duplicates, PASS. Load after each measured rung 20.32 and 22.87 on four CPUs. The 3000 rung failed during connection setup before any writes, so the ladder stopped and no 3000 capacity claim is made. Owned server snapshots during ramp showed disconnected sockets and a busy co-located generator; the report does not identify a saturated server resource."
